      "id": "post-1",
      "authorName": "Rameshwar Sharma",
      "authorGotra": "Bharadwaj",
      "authorCity": "Jaipur",
      "category": "Announcement",
      "title": "Preparation Schedule for Monthly Maha Satsang & Annakshetra",
      "content": "Jai Shri Garhveer Baba. All devotees and seva volunteers are requested to gather at the main sanctum courtyard by 6:00 AM this Sunday for morning Abhishek, Bhajan Sandhya, and Annakshetra Prasad Seva. Families traveling from Sikar and Jhunjhunu may register their arrival at the Yatri Niwas desk.",
      "imageUrl": "/src/assets/images/math_sanctum_banner_1795533370707.jpg",
      "likes": 29,
      "pinned": true,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "c-1",
          "authorName": "Savitri Devi Choudhary",
          "authorCity": "Sikar",
          "text": "Jai Baba ki. Our Sikar seva group will arrive Saturday evening to help with flower garlands and prasad preparation.",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-24T12:20:25.822Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-1795533656724",
          "authorName": "Harish Chandra",
          "text": "Jai Baba ki, looking forward to Sunday Satsang.",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-24T15:20:56.724Z"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-11-24T10:20:25.822Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "post-2",
      "authorName": "Savitri Devi Choudhary",
      "authorGotra": "Kashyap",
      "authorCity": "Sikar",
      "category": "Seva",
      "title": "Successful Samuhik Prasad Seva — Over 450 Devotees Served",
      "content": "With the blessings of Shri Garhveer Baba and tireless dedication from our youth volunteers, yesterday’s Annakshetra Bhandara concluded peacefully with warm sattvic prasad served to over 450 devotees and travelers.",
      "imageUrl": "/src/assets/images/community_satsang_event_1795533370501.jpg",
      "likes": 42,
      "pinned": false,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "c-2",
          "authorName": "Devendra Joshi",
          "authorCity": "Alwar",
          "text": "Heartfelt gratitude to all volunteers who arranged everything so respectfully.",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-24T01:20:25.822Z"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-11-23T21:20:25.822Z"
    },
    {
