      "content": "Please note the revised winter schedule at Shri Garhveer Baba Math: Mangala Aarti at 5:30 AM, Shringar Darshan at 8:00 AM, and Sandhya Deep Aarti at 6:15 PM daily. Devotees may offer Deepdan Seva before sunset.",
